{
    "title": "Square Invoices: Invoice Maker",
    "description": "<b>The free Square Invoices</b> app is your go-to invoice maker that lets you get paid from anywhere. With the app, you can easily send bills and estimates, track payment status, set auto-reminders for upcoming invoices, monitor your cash flow, and manage your finances. There are no monthly fees or commitments.\r\n\r\n<b>ANY BUSINESS</b> Whether you\u2019re a small business, contractor, or freelancer, it's easy to create and send your customers estimates for a job and request deposits quickly. Our templates will help guide you through the invoicing and receipt process. It\u2019s an essential invoicing solution that supports any business:\r\n\u25ba Home & Repair: Contractors, Landscaping, Cleaning, Plumbing\r\n\u25ba Food & Drink: Catering, Bakeries, Wholesale Stores\r\n\u25ba Professional Services: Web Designers, Photographers, Consultants, Accountants\r\n\r\n<b>All the tools you need to run your business from one place.</b>\r\n\u25ba Estimates, invoices, contracts, receipts, and bills with just a few taps\r\n\u25ba Create and send professional invoices from simple templates.\r\n\u25ba Customize estimates and invoices with logos, line items, attachments, messages, and color schemes\r\n\u25ba Accept any payment: credit and debit cards, Google Pay, cash, check, or ACH payment.\r\n\u25ba Send invoices wherever your customers prefer\u2014email, URL, or text message\r\n\u25ba Track online invoice status: viewed, paid, unpaid, or overdue.\r\n\u25ba Save time with auto-reminders, or set up recurring billing and keep debit or credit cards on file\r\n\u25ba Set taxes automatically apply when you add items to your invoice\r\n\u25ba Collect customer information, take deposits, and view payment insights instantly\r\n\u25ba Edit, save, and reuse digital contract templates with digital signatures and payments\r\n\u25ba Easily convert estimates to invoices\r\n\r\n<b>ESTIMATE AND INVOICE MAKER</b>\r\nBook your next job by sending an estimate your clients can approve with one click. Easily convert an approved estimate into an invoice from the app. Create and send professional invoices and estimates easily with simple-to-use invoice templates. Enter the customer's email and payment amount, and click \"Send invoice\" to finish.\r\n\r\n<b>ACCEPT ANY KIND OF PAYMENT</b>\r\nCustomers can pay their invoices online or make payments in person with any major debit or credit card, Apple Pay, Google Pay, cash, check, or ACH payment.\r\n\r\n<b>NO MONTHLY FEES WITH UNLIMITED INVOICES</b>\r\nSend unlimited invoices and estimates free with no monthly fees. Only pay when you take a payment. 3.3% + $0.30 for card payments, and for ACH payments only 1% per transaction with a minimum fee. There are no fees for checks or cash payments.\r\n\r\n<b>AUTOMATIC REMINDERS AND INVOICE TRACKING</b>\r\nStop chasing down payments. Set automatic payment reminders before, on, or after the due date of an invoice or send one-time payment reminders as needed. Manage your receivables and improve accounting and finance with this software.\r\n\r\n<b>FLEXIBLE BILLING & INVOICING</b>\r\nGet paid on your schedule. Request deposits from your clients, schedule multi-payment schedules from a single invoice, or set up recurring invoices for weekly or monthly billing.\r\n\r\n<b>MANAGE BUSINESS FROM ONE SOLUTION</b>\r\nSay goodbye to complex accounting. Easily monitor your finances with built-in reporting that automatically syncs across all your devices. Save time with cards on file for auto-billing and keep your information organized in one place, including receipts and finance records.\r\n\r\n<b>INSTANT ACCESS TO FUNDS</b>\r\nAccess your funds in real-time with the Square Card or instantly transfer funds to your bank account for 1.75% of the deposit amount. Next business day deposits come standard.\r\n\r\nSquare Invoices is an all-in-one app for your payments and business needs.\r\n\r\nReach Support by calling 1-855-700-6000 or reach us by mail at:\r\nBlock, Inc.\r\n1955 Broadway, Suite 600\r\nOakland, CA 94612",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>The free Square Invoices</b> app is your go-to invoice maker that lets you get paid from anywhere. With the app, you can easily send bills and estimates, track payment status, set auto-reminders for upcoming invoices, monitor your cash flow, and manage your finances. There are no monthly fees or commitments.<br><br><b>ANY BUSINESS</b> Whether you\u2019re a small business, contractor, or freelancer, it&#39;s easy to create and send your customers estimates for a job and request deposits quickly. Our templates will help guide you through the invoicing and receipt process. It\u2019s an essential invoicing solution that supports any business:<br>\u25ba Home &amp; Repair: Contractors, Landscaping, Cleaning, Plumbing<br>\u25ba Food &amp; Drink: Catering, Bakeries, Wholesale Stores<br>\u25ba Professional Services: Web Designers, Photographers, Consultants, Accountants<br><br><b>All the tools you need to run your business from one place.</b><br>\u25ba Estimates, invoices, contracts, receipts, and bills with just a few taps<br>\u25ba Create and send professional invoices from simple templates.<br>\u25ba Customize estimates and invoices with logos, line items, attachments, messages, and color schemes<br>\u25ba Accept any payment: credit and debit cards, Google Pay, cash, check, or ACH payment.<br>\u25ba Send invoices wherever your customers prefer\u2014email, URL, or text message<br>\u25ba Track online invoice status: viewed, paid, unpaid, or overdue.<br>\u25ba Save time with auto-reminders, or set up recurring billing and keep debit or credit cards on file<br>\u25ba Set taxes automatically apply when you add items to your invoice<br>\u25ba Collect customer information, take deposits, and view payment insights instantly<br>\u25ba Edit, save, and reuse digital contract templates with digital signatures and payments<br>\u25ba Easily convert estimates to invoices<br><br><b>ESTIMATE AND INVOICE MAKER</b><br>Book your next job by sending an estimate your clients can approve with one click. Easily convert an approved estimate into an invoice from the app. Create and send professional invoices and estimates easily with simple-to-use invoice templates. Enter the customer&#39;s email and payment amount, and click &quot;Send invoice&quot; to finish.<br><br><b>ACCEPT ANY KIND OF PAYMENT</b><br>Customers can pay their invoices online or make payments in person with any major debit or credit card, Apple Pay, Google Pay, cash, check, or ACH payment.<br><br><b>NO MONTHLY FEES WITH UNLIMITED INVOICES</b><br>Send unlimited invoices and estimates free with no monthly fees. Only pay when you take a payment. 3.3% + $0.30 for card payments, and for ACH payments only 1% per transaction with a minimum fee. There are no fees for checks or cash payments.<br><br><b>AUTOMATIC REMINDERS AND INVOICE TRACKING</b><br>Stop chasing down payments. Set automatic payment reminders before, on, or after the due date of an invoice or send one-time payment reminders as needed. Manage your receivables and improve accounting and finance with this software.<br><br><b>FLEXIBLE BILLING &amp; INVOICING</b><br>Get paid on your schedule. Request deposits from your clients, schedule multi-payment schedules from a single invoice, or set up recurring invoices for weekly or monthly billing.<br><br><b>MANAGE BUSINESS FROM ONE SOLUTION</b><br>Say goodbye to complex accounting. Easily monitor your finances with built-in reporting that automatically syncs across all your devices. Save time with cards on file for auto-billing and keep your information organized in one place, including receipts and finance records.<br><br><b>INSTANT ACCESS TO FUNDS</b><br>Access your funds in real-time with the Square Card or instantly transfer funds to your bank account for 1.75% of the deposit amount. Next business day deposits come standard.<br><br>Square Invoices is an all-in-one app for your payments and business needs.<br><br>Reach Support by calling 1-855-700-6000 or reach us by mail at:<br>Block, Inc.<br>1955 Broadway, Suite 600<br>Oakland, CA 94612",
